atus": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199037125650/", "num_games_owned": 66, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4511, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3725, "last_played": 1771073213, "avatar": "39bbb6ff6e5b73d356d4a94a405628bf6d83f2da"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Helldivers 2 es un juego que ofrece una experiencia de acción cooperativa inigualable. Con su jugabilidad adictiva, gráficos impresionantes y un enfoque en el trabajo en equipo, es una adición imprescindible para cualquier fanático de los juegos de acción. Si estás buscando un juego que te mantenga entretenido durante horas y te ofrezca desafíos constantes, Helldivers 2 es la elección perfecta..", "timestamp_created": 1732379982, "timestamp_updated": 1732965661, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179627953", "author": {"steamid": "76561199258369845", "personaname": "DonGancito", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sebasan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 16688, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 370, "playtime_at_review": 1348, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1288, "last_played": 1787780952, "avatar": "e123051ffc4f07e73737d58c17e3bee71366fc34"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "POR LA DEMOCRACIA!", "timestamp_created": 1732350258, "timestamp_updated": 1732350258, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179626008", "author": {"steamid": "76561199207191772", "personaname": "SandKatze", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199207191772/", "num_games_owned": 162, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2790, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1430, "last_played": 1785116765, "avatar": "b2c0f6ee35e24dd0c577dfc3d873ea005e0da8c2"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "GOTY PAPA GOTY", "timestamp_created": 1732347518, "timestamp_updated": 1732347518, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179611874", "author": {"steamid": "76561198913999541", "personaname": "Duque Terere", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198913999541/", "num_games_owned": 74, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 11684, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 79, "playtime_at_review": 8387, "last_played": 1787708192, "avatar": "a0bb155a1e4403a837735a78b4c0f296ebb50570"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Juego extremadamente divertido y con una capacidad para la inmersión que da miedo! en su momento me parecía algo elevado su precio pero ahora veo la razón, la variedad de armas, estratagemas y ventajas hacen cada partida algo muy dinámico y variado ! me encanta la comunidad y el chiste en si del juego con el patriotismo estupido y demas ! es una de las comunidades mas pacificas que e visto (exceptuando a los raros que piden PVP) \n\nEn lo personal casi no tuve problemas con bugs o problemas de mala conexión pero si existen y pues bueno si son algo molestos pero en general el juego esta bien hecho en mi opinión.\nEs verdad que si le dedicas mas de 7-10 horas al dia puede volverse algo aburrido pero el juego cumple con su función, ser divertido y hacerte pasar un buen rato \n10/10 emocionado por el futuro del juego \nPORFAVOR AÑADAN BATALLAS MASIVAS DE PVE SERIA GENIAL Y MUY GRACIOSO VER COMO LA MITAD DEL TEAM MUERE POR FUEGO AMIGO", "timestamp_created": 1732327637, "timestamp_updated": 1732327637, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179608697", "author": {"steamid": "76561198254187878", "personaname": "egirsox_dlp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198254187878/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 13079, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9992, "last_played": 1786556149, "avatar": "4f7bcfd19d6cfaec1b48a8d5b6512100e46b3059"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Al principio, uno tiene miedo, debe dejar a su familia atrás para luchar contra los bichos fascistas, o los robots comunistas. Y da miedo. Recuerdo un día en Malevelon Creek, fue horrible, Junior, un muchacho de Atlantis City, explotó en mil pedazos... Pues lo que os decía, Junior era un muchacho alegre, no le había hecho daño a nadie, y murió. Apenas tenía 19 años, cuando cogió un rifle sin retroceso por primera vez. Pero lo que más le fascinaba eran los águilas. Ya sabes, esas naves que hacen pium pium a todo.\nOh... que recuerdos... ah, el juego bien, recomendado.", "timestamp_created": 1732323253, "timestamp_updated": 1732323253, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179608606", "author": {"steamid": "76561198824830661", "personaname": "agustinld76", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198824830661/", "num_games_owned": 182, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 51045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 694, "playtime_at_review": 13531, "last_played": 1788066763, "avatar": "b66c60af51d3a26a60601498aef5e465d0cd370c"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "si repartir democracia en el HD1 era divertido, aca la diversion es x2", "timestamp_created": 1732323131, "timestamp_updated": 1732323131, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507575750350952148", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179575119", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021948577", "personaname": "b3n4r3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198021948577/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 32433, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17480, "last_played": 1786135856, "avatar": "6789f87061e30926e69474562de0db02845c0f46"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Crash, crash crash, more crashes with each update, till u can't play, obviously they don't accept refund after X hours played. The game is badly optimized, too many bugs, instability, and after a year for me personaly, after the last update unplayable, i don't see this time any solution.", "timestamp_created": 1732288146, "timestamp_updated": 1743175856, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.438596516847610474", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179555976", "author": {"steamid": "76561198378752977", "perso